    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37276" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pōtātor</span></b> ,
		ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				drinker</i>, <i>toper</i>, <i>bibber</i> (ante- and post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">potatores maximi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 2, 2, 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 52</span></i>
			, n. 11; cf. <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt. 11, 19</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(opp. vorator),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Monogr. 8 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					16, 476</span></i>
			.</div>
